:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>暴雨冲刷着断桅沉船滩的礁石，<<else>>退潮后的断桅沉船滩礁石间，<</if>>半截腐朽的船尾舵轮卡在石缝里，轮轴铜套内塞着一卷涂蜡帆布。铜套外侧扣着一圈带六角螺母的加固铜箍。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 is 1>>
断桅沉船滩的船尾舵轮铜套今日已掏空，潮水正漫过石缝。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "别开舵轮铜套 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8")>><<money 300>>铜套应声松脱，涂蜡帆布里裹着几枚旧港银币与水路标图。<<else>>舵轮铜套应声松脱，轮轴内壁在退潮海风中显得干爽整洁。<</if>><span class="green">你在沉船舵轮里起获了旧港藏货。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	舵轮木刺扎了一下虎口，浪花拍湿了鞋面。<span class="red">你甩干手上的水珠退上高礁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">别开舵轮铜套 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "旋下铜箍取帆布 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>螺母顺滑旋出，你完整取出了未沾半点海水的涂蜡帆布包。<<else>>六角螺母顺滑旋出，你将舵轮铜箍重新校准固定妥当。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你凭精巧手法卸下了舵轮暗筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	螺母被海盐锈死，拧动时磨红了指节。<span class="red">你摸出小油壶准备先润透螺口。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回外层 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">旋下铜箍取帆布 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雾笼罩着雾角栈桥的系船柱，<<else>>海风掠过雾角栈桥末端的系船柱，<</if>>铁锚链环下压着一只被海浪冲上来的红铜信号哨匣。石阶角落正好散落着两块修船剩下的硬木楔。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 is 1>>
雾角栈桥锚链下的红铜信号哨匣今日已取走，铁链随浪轻晃。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">
<<swimicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>><<link "踩稳石阶抬锚链 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9")>><<money 300>>锚链挪开半寸，你顺利抽出了装着防水银票的红铜哨匣。<<else>>沉重的铁锚链挪开半寸，石槽底部的排水沟顿时恢复通畅。<</if>><span class="green">你凭臂力移开铁锚链取出了哨匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锚链滑腻沉重，手心一滑差点闪了腰。<span class="red">你扶住石柱先缓了一口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回主路 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">踩稳石阶抬锚链 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "垫环翘起锚链 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>木楔稳稳撑开链环，你毫不费力地勾出了底下的红铜哨匣。<<else>>硬木楔稳稳撑开链环，潮水顺着石缝平缓地退向远海。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">杠杆巧劲让你轻松拿到了哨匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木楔在湿石上滑脱，溅起一串冷水花。<span class="red">你换了一块干硬橡木楔准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岔道口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">垫环翘起锚链 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>守塔人旧居阁楼的备用透镜箱锁扣松脱，箱底绒布下露出一角夹着津贴券的灯塔交接簿。绒布上方还压着一枚沉甸甸的备用椭圆形水晶透镜。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 is 1>>
守塔人旧居阁楼的备用透镜箱今日已整理妥当，箱盖严密合拢。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "夹出绒布底簿 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3")>><<money 300>>交接簿完好抽出，内页夹着几张未兑付的航标津贴券。<<else>>皮革交接簿翻开后字迹清晰，早年的航标记录保存得完好如初。<</if>><span class="green">你在透镜箱底寻获了守塔津贴。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	透镜边缘锋利，擦过了你的手背。<span class="red">你包好手背退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">夹出绒布底簿 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "托透镜掀绒布 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>水晶透镜安稳移开，你将底衬下的交接簿与信物铜牌悉数收好。<<else>>水晶透镜安稳归位，折射出的灯火将整间灯室照得通明。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">稳妥手法护住了珍贵透镜与账册。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	透镜沉重冰凉，托举时手腕一阵发酸。<span class="red">你先把透镜放回槽位歇手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">托透镜掀绒布 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>海蚀回音廊中段的石壁风孔在涨潮时发出低沉嗡鸣，气孔内侧卡着一只密封的鲸骨小筒。气孔边缘的石钉上挂着一圈用来疏通孔道的细铜丝。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 is 1>>
海蚀回音廊风孔内的鲸骨小筒今日已取出，风声清越通透。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "趁退浪勾鲸骨筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4")>><<money 300>>你在下一波涌浪前精准勾出鲸骨筒，里面装着两枚古银币。<<else>>你在涌浪拍来前精准探入石缝，潮水洞的回音显得格外低沉。<</if>><span class="green">回音廊的风声随之变得清亮悦耳。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	涌浪提前拍入风孔，冷海水灌湿了整条衣袖。<span class="red">你拧干衣袖退回干石台。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">趁退浪勾鲸骨筒 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "套出鲸骨筒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>铜丝圈稳稳套住筒身，鲸骨小筒顺着石槽滑入你掌心。<<else>>铜丝圈稳稳套住凹槽边缘，顺着石槽将漂流浮木理到一旁。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你巧用铜丝套出了风孔藏筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开暗径 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风孔气流湍急，吹偏了细铜丝的圈口。<span class="red">你把铜丝折成硬钩准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">套出鲸骨筒 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>守塔人石屋后墙的储水铜桶底座下垫着一块刻字的压舱铅块，铅块底部凹槽里藏着一枚防水铜币匣。储水铜桶下方的黄铜放水龙头还能顺畅拧动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 is 1>>
守塔人石屋储水铜桶下的压舱铅块今日已放稳，滴水声平缓规律。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "撬起桶角取匣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10")>><<money 320>>储水桶微微倾斜，你迅速抽出压舱铅块下的防水铜币匣。<<else>>备用储水铜桶微微倾斜，桶底的压舱铅块依旧稳固如初。<</if>><span class="green">你撬起储水桶底座拿到了铜币匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜桶盛满雨水颇为沉重，铁钎滑了一下。<span class="red">你调整铁钎支点准备再试。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回原路 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">撬起桶角取匣 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "放水搬铅块 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>水位下降后铜桶轻了大半，你毫不费力地取出了铅块下的铜币匣。<<else>>泄水阀排空余水后铜桶轻了大半，底座石台被冲洗得干干净净。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">放水减重后你稳妥取出了铜币匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	龙头铜栓有些生涩，冷水溅湿了手腕。<span class="red">你擦干手腕准备再用力拧栓。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">放水搬铅块 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
