:: MP Region Moment Abbey 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>静默石阶中段的壁龛里放着一只积灰的纯银香炉，炉盖镂空缝隙间卡着一枚修道院古银币。香炉旁边的笔架上搁着几根挑香灰用的细竹签。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_8 is 1>>
静默石阶壁龛里的纯银香炉今日已擦拭端正，檀香余味幽远。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-abbey-8">
<<templeicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "旋开香炉顶盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-abbey-8">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_abbey_8")>><<money 300>>炉盖旋开，你将古银币与底部的安神香片一并收入怀中。<<else>>三足铜炉盖顺滑旋开，炉底残存的安神香灰散发着幽幽清香。<</if>><span class="green">你旋开香炉取出了奉纳古币。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	香灰凝结卡住了螺纹，硬拧时刮红了虎口。<span class="red">你拍散炉沿香灰准备再拧。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回原路 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">旋开香炉顶盖 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "挑出花纹铜币 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-abbey-8">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_abbey_8_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>古古铜徽章顺着莲花镂孔轻巧滑出，连炉内香灰都未曾惊动分毫。<<else>>莲花镂孔疏通后气流匀净，铜炉内的檀香余韵绵长。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你用巧手挑出了香炉里的古币。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	竹签尖端在银棱上滑偏，折断了半寸。<span class="red">你换了一根韧竹签准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回主通道 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挑出花纹铜币 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Abbey 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>告解回音壁后方的传声石管口塞着一团防潮羊皮卷，隐约能看见封口处的银粉字迹。传声石管内壁光滑，轻拍回音壁便可借共鸣气流推动管内轻物。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_9 is 1>>
告解回音壁后方的传声石管今日已疏通，细微耳语清晰可闻。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-abbey-9">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link "夹出防潮羊皮卷 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-abbey-9">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_abbey_9")>><<money 300>>羊皮卷被完整拉出，里面包着几枚古教团银币与礼拜日程。<<else>>管风琴最右侧的铜音管疏通完毕，低音共鸣重新变得浑厚澄澈。<</if>><span class="green">你取出了传声管里的羊皮密卷。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石管内壁潮湿粗糙，擦痛了你的手背。<span class="red">你缩回手擦去石粉。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">夹出防潮羊皮卷 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "拍回音壁推纸卷 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-abbey-9">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_abbey_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_abbey_9_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>声波共鸣将羊皮卷稳稳推到管口，你伸手便接住了里面的古铜徽章。<<else>>声波共鸣将音管内的积尘震落，修道院回廊里回荡着清越余音。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你借声学共鸣巧妙取出了纸卷。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	拍击石板的节奏稍乱，纸卷只在管口晃了一下。<span class="red">你定神找准共鸣点准备再拍。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拍回音壁推纸卷 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Abbey 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>灰烬藏经阁的石砌书台下有一格松动的垫脚青砖，砖缝里露出半只锡制封蜡盒。书台底座下方压着两块用来稳固台面的铸铁配重块。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_3 is 1>>
灰烬藏经阁书台下的垫脚青砖今日已归位，地面平整如初。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-3">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "撬起垫脚青砖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_abbey_3")>><<money 300>>青砖掀起，你取出锡制封蜡盒与里面的泥金残页和旧银币。<<else>>松动的青砖平稳掀起又归回原位，石阶暗格内干燥整洁。<</if>><span class="green">你在抄经台下寻获了封蜡锡盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	裁纸刀刃口偏薄，撬砖时崩出了一声脆响。<span class="red">你忙按住刀柄左右看了看。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">撬起垫脚青砖 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "挪配重抽青砖 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_abbey_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>配重移开后青砖轻松滑出，锡盒完好无损地落在你手中。<<else>>配重石移开后青砖严丝合缝地落槽，看不出半点翻动痕迹。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你稳妥移开配重取出了锡盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	书台底座积满陈年灰尘，呛得你轻轻咳嗽。<span class="red">你拂去浮尘准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回外层 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挪配重抽青砖 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Abbey 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>地下暗河渡口的石拱桥墩水线处挂着一只防水牛皮袋，袋口铜环卡在石雕水兽的獠牙上。渡口石阶边拴着一叶窄长的柏木舟，船头搁着一根铁头长篙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_4 is 1>>
地下暗河渡口桥墩上的牛皮袋今日已解下，暗河水波平静流淌。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-4">
<<swimicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "撑舟解下牛皮袋 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_abbey_4")>><<money 300>>木舟稳稳贴近桥墩，你一把摘下牛皮袋，收妥里面的渡口银币。<<else>>平底木舟稳稳贴近桥墩，暗河水面映出摇曳的防风灯光。<</if>><span class="green">你撑舟靠近桥墩取下了牛皮袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗河回流晃动船身，冰冷河水溅湿了靴尖。<span class="red">你稳住竹篙先把木舟撑回岸阶。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回主路 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">撑舟解下牛皮袋 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "挑环取袋 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-abbey-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_abbey_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_abbey_4_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>长篙铁钩一挑即中，防水牛皮袋顺着篙杆滑进你怀里。<<else>>长篙铁钩精准勾住系船铁环，将木舟稳稳固定在渡口石阶旁。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你在岸上巧用长篙挑回了皮袋。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开暗径 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水兽石雕湿滑，长篙钩尖滑脱了一下。<span class="red">你擦干铁钩准备看准角度再挑。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岔道口 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挑环取袋 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Moment Abbey 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>静默石阶底部的石雕圣水盆背面有一道暗槽，里面塞着一只用亚麻布包裹的古教团奉纳银盒。圣水盆边缘的铜托盘里放着一把修剪灯芯的长柄黄铜烛剪。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
