:: MP Region Encounter Velvet 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>露台观海雅座的丝绒靠垫夹缝里卡着一只金丝零钱包，搭扣上嵌着一枚红宝石胸针。雅座外侧垂着厚重的防风纱幔，海风吹拂时恰好遮住视线。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3 is 1>>
露台观海雅座的丝绒靠垫今日已整理平整，海风吹拂着轻纱帷幔。
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "坐雅座摸钱包 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
