	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前进 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	胸针别针未扣严，轻轻扎了一下你的指尖。<span class="red">你按住指尖假装看海缓了缓。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">坐雅座摸钱包 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "借海风解纱幔扣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
