	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>白纱翻飞间你已解下胸针与零钱包，不留半点翻动痕迹。<<else>>白纱帷幔随海风轻扬，露台栏杆边的银烛台被你扶得稳稳当当。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你借轻纱掩护巧手取下了零钱包。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
