:: MP Region Encounter Observatory 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>钟楼连廊的石雕排水兽口中衔着一枚带铜链的测风仪小锤，锤心空腔里藏着观测员的私房钱。铜链另一端顺着石壁上的风速表导引铜管一直延伸到连廊内侧。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_observatory_4 is 1>>
钟楼连廊石雕排水兽口中的测风仪小锤今日已复原，穿堂风清凉。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-4">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "握铜链取小锤 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_observatory_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_observatory_4")>><<money 300>>你迎着高处清风稳稳取出小锤，拧开底盖收好里面的银币。<<else>>你迎着高处清风扶正风杯转轴，测风仪在飞扶壁外轻快旋转。<</if>><span class="green">你从石兽口中取出了测风仪铜锤。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	屋顶阵风吹乱衣摆，你的手肘磕在窗框石棱上。<span class="red">你揉着小臂退回连廊内侧。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">握铜链取小锤 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "拉回铜链 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_observatory_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_observatory_4_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>铜链顺着导管滑回窗内，你安全拧开小锤取出了私房古铜徽章。<<else>>铜链顺着导管平稳滑回窗内，钟楼连廊的百叶窗被你扣紧锁好。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你从连廊内侧巧拉铜链拿到了小锤。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开暗径 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜链在石槽转角处卡了一下，拉动时磨红了手心。<span class="red">你抖动铜链松开卡点准备再拉。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拉回铜链 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
